      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEE NO GRIEF (7) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led for much of the way before being grabbed late, finishing a neck second at this track over 401m in 23.02. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Must come into calculations. ZIPPING KAREEM (8) copped a check in the run last time and never threatened when seventh (20.38) in a Maiden at this track. May be worth another try. ZIPPING KAWHI (2) jumped from the middle and safely held on debut at this track over 320m (19.14). Meets a moderate line up and should do much better. HUNKY DORY (6) makes debut for the Victor Sultana kennel. Can run a bold race on debut.",
